{"seq":1,"slug":"opentelemetry-sdk","title":"OpenTelemetry SDK 架构与生产配置","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/distributed-tracing/implementation/opentelemetry-sdk","wordCount":1057,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"opentelemetry-sdk-架构与生产配置\">OpenTelemetry SDK 架构与生产配置</h1><p>OpenTelemetry 是 CNCF 第二活跃的项目（仅次于 Kubernetes），截至 2026 年已被 48.5% 的组织采用，81% 的工程团队将其视为可观测性战略的核心。Go SDK v1.44、Python SDK、Java Agent 等已全面稳定。本文深入 OTel SDK 的内部架构——TracerProvider、SpanProcessor、Exporter 的职责分层与生命周期管理——并给出经过生产验证的配置方案。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>OTel SDK 的核心架构围绕 TracerProvider 展开——它是 Tracer 的工厂、Sampler 的宿主、SpanProcessor 链的注册中心。理解 Provider → Tracer → Span → Processor → Exporter 这条数据流转链路，是正确配置 SDK 的基础。</p>\n<h2 id=\"tracerprovider-架构\">TracerProvider 架构</h2><p>TracerProvider 是 SDK 的核心入口，负责创建 Tracer 实例、管理 Resource 信息、注册 SpanProcessor 链：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    APP[&quot;应用代码&quot;] --&gt; TRACER[&quot;Tracer&lt;br/&gt;(per library/module)&quot;]&#10;    TRACER --&gt; SPAN[&quot;Span 创建&quot;]&#10;    SPAN --&gt; SAMPLER[&quot;Sampler&lt;br/&gt;采样决策&quot;]&#10;    SAMPLER --&gt;|&quot;采样&quot;| PROC[&quot;SpanProcessor 链&quot;]&#10;    SAMPLER --&gt;|&quot;不采样&quot;| NOOP[&quot;No-op Span&lt;br/&gt;(零开销)&quot;]&#10;    PROC --&gt; BSP[&quot;BatchSpanProcessor&lt;br/&gt;批量缓冲&quot;]&#10;    BSP --&gt; EXP[&quot;Exporter&lt;br/&gt;(OTLP/Jaeger/Console)&quot;]&#10;&#10;    subgraph TP[&quot;TracerProvider&quot;]&#10;        TRACER&#10;        SAMPLER&#10;        PROC&#10;        BSP&#10;        EXP&#10;        RES[&quot;Resource&lt;br/&gt;service.name, env, version&quot;]&#10;    end\">flowchart TD\n    APP[\"应用代码\"] --&gt; TRACER[\"Tracer&lt;br/&gt;(per library/module)\"]\n    TRACER --&gt; SPAN[\"Span 创建\"]\n    SPAN --&gt; SAMPLER[\"Sampler&lt;br/&gt;采样决策\"]\n    SAMPLER --&gt;|\"采样\"| PROC[\"SpanProcessor 链\"]\n    SAMPLER --&gt;|\"不采样\"| NOOP[\"No-op Span&lt;br/&gt;(零开销)\"]\n    PROC --&gt; BSP[\"BatchSpanProcessor&lt;br/&gt;批量缓冲\"]\n    BSP --&gt; EXP[\"Exporter&lt;br/&gt;(OTLP/Jaeger/Console)\"]\n\n    subgraph TP[\"TracerProvider\"]\n        TRACER\n        SAMPLER\n        PROC\n        BSP\n        EXP\n        RES[\"Resource&lt;br/&gt;service.name, env, version\"]\n    end</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>组件</th>\n<th>职责</th>\n<th>生命周期</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>TracerProvider</td>\n<td>全局单例，持有所有配置</td>\n<td>应用启动时创建，关闭时 <code>Shutdown()</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Tracer</td>\n<td>按 Instrumentation Scope 分组创建 Span</td>\n<td>从 Provider 获取，无需手动关闭</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Sampler</td>\n<td>决定新 Span 是否被记录</td>\n<td>Provider 创建时绑定</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>SpanProcessor</td>\n<td>接收已结束的 Span，处理后交给 Exporter</td>\n<td>注册在 Provider 上</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Exporter</td>\n<td>将 Span 数据发送到外部后端</td>\n<td>由 SpanProcessor 持有</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"spanprocessor-simple-vs-batch\">SpanProcessor：Simple vs Batch</h2><p>SpanProcessor 决定了 Span 数据何时、以何种方式发送到后端：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>处理器</th>\n<th>行为</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>SimpleSpanProcessor</td>\n<td>Span 结束后立即同步发送</td>\n<td>开发调试，低吞吐场景</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>BatchSpanProcessor</td>\n<td>批量缓冲，异步定期发送</td>\n<td><strong>生产环境默认</strong></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"batchspanprocessor-关键参数\">BatchSpanProcessor 关键参数</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>参数</th>\n<th>默认值</th>\n<th>生产推荐</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>MaxQueueSize</code></td>\n<td>2048</td>\n<td>4096-8192</td>\n<td>内存队列容量，满时新 Span 被丢弃</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>BatchTimeout</code></td>\n<td>5s</td>\n<td>5s</td>\n<td>批次发送间隔</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>MaxExportBatchSize</code></td>\n<td>512</td>\n<td>512-1024</td>\n<td>单批最大 Span 数</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>ExportTimeout</code></td>\n<td>30s</td>\n<td>10s</td>\n<td>单次导出的超时时间</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>生产调优思路：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><code>MaxQueueSize</code> 应 ≥ <code>峰值 QPS × BatchTimeout</code> 以避免丢弃</li>\n<li><code>ExportTimeout</code> 需小于 <code>BatchTimeout</code>，否则导出阻塞会积压队列</li>\n<li>监控 <code>otel.bsp.spans.dropped</code> 指标，非零说明队列溢出</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"exporter-选型\">Exporter 选型</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Exporter</th>\n<th>协议</th>\n<th>特点</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>OTLP gRPC</td>\n<td>HTTP/2 + Protobuf</td>\n<td><strong>推荐默认</strong>，高效二进制传输</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>OTLP HTTP</td>\n<td>HTTP/1.1 + Protobuf/JSON</td>\n<td>穿越 LB/代理更方便</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Jaeger</td>\n<td>Thrift/gRPC</td>\n<td>直连 Jaeger Collector（逐步弃用）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Zipkin</td>\n<td>HTTP + JSON</td>\n<td>兼容 Zipkin 后端</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Console</td>\n<td>stdout</td>\n<td>开发调试</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>从 2026 年起，Jaeger 官方推荐通过 OTLP 接收数据而非 Jaeger 专有协议。直接使用 OTLP Exporter 即可对接 Jaeger、Tempo、Datadog 等所有主流后端。</p>\n<h2 id=\"自动插桩与手动插桩\">自动插桩与手动插桩</h2><p>OpenTelemetry 提供两种插桩方式，通常在生产中组合使用：</p>\n<h3 id=\"自动插桩-zero-code\">自动插桩（Zero-code）</h3><p>通过语言特定的 Agent/Hook 自动为已知框架注入 Span：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>语言</th>\n<th>机制</th>\n<th>覆盖范围</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Java</td>\n<td><code>-javaagent:opentelemetry-javaagent.jar</code></td>\n<td>200+ 库/框架</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Python</td>\n<td><code>opentelemetry-instrument</code> CLI</td>\n<td>FastAPI, Django, Flask, SQLAlchemy, Redis...</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Node.js</td>\n<td><code>--require @opentelemetry/auto-instrumentations-node</code></td>\n<td>Express, Koa, pg, mysql2...</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>.NET</td>\n<td><code>DOTNET_STARTUP_HOOKS</code></td>\n<td>ASP.NET Core, EF Core, HttpClient...</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Go</td>\n<td>需手动注册（编译型语言限制）</td>\n<td><code>net/http</code>, gRPC, database/sql</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"手动插桩-manual\">手动插桩（Manual）</h3><p>在业务关键路径添加自定义 Span，提供自动插桩无法覆盖的语义：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"go\" data-code=\"func ProcessPayment(ctx context.Context, order Order) error {&#10;    ctx, span := tracer.Start(ctx, &quot;ProcessPayment&quot;,&#10;        trace.WithAttributes(&#10;            attribute.String(&quot;order.id&quot;, order.ID),&#10;            attribute.Float64(&quot;order.amount&quot;, order.Amount),&#10;        ),&#10;    )&#10;    defer span.End()&#10;&#10;    // 风控检查&#10;    ctx, riskSpan := tracer.Start(ctx, &quot;RiskCheck&quot;)&#10;    result := riskEngine.Evaluate(ctx, order)&#10;    riskSpan.SetAttributes(attribute.String(&quot;risk.level&quot;, result.Level))&#10;    riskSpan.End()&#10;&#10;    if result.Blocked {&#10;        span.SetStatus(codes.Error, &quot;payment blocked by risk engine&quot;)&#10;        return ErrPaymentBlocked&#10;    }&#10;    return nil&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">func</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ProcessPayment</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">ctx</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> context</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Context</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">order</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Order</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">error</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    ctx, span </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> tracer.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Start</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(ctx, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"ProcessPayment\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        trace.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">WithAttributes</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            attribute.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">String</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"order.id\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, order.ID),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            attribute.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Float64</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"order.amount\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, order.Amount),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        ),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    )</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    defer</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> span.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">End</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    // 风控检查</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    ctx, riskSpan </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> tracer.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Start</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(ctx, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"RiskCheck\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    result </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> riskEngine.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Evaluate</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(ctx, order)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    riskSpan.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">SetAttributes</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(attribute.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">String</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"risk.level\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, result.Level))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    riskSpan.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">End</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> result.Blocked {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        span.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">SetStatus</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(codes.Error, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"payment blocked by risk engine\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ErrPaymentBlocked</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> nil</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"最佳实践-span-粒度控制\">最佳实践：Span 粒度控制</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>做法</th>\n<th>建议</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>每个 HTTP handler 一个 Span</td>\n<td>自动插桩已覆盖</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>每次外部调用一个 Span</td>\n<td>自动插桩已覆盖</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>关键业务逻辑块一个 Span</td>\n<td>手动添加</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>循环内每次迭代一个 Span</td>\n<td><strong>避免</strong> — Span 数量爆炸</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>纯计算函数一个 Span</td>\n<td><strong>避免</strong> — 增加开销无洞察</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"resource-配置\">Resource 配置</h2><p>Resource 描述产生 Span 的实体身份，是后端构建服务拓扑和做聚合分析的基础：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"go\" data-code=\"resource.New(ctx,&#10;    resource.WithAttributes(&#10;        semconv.ServiceName(&quot;payment-service&quot;),&#10;        semconv.ServiceVersion(&quot;2.4.1&quot;),&#10;        semconv.DeploymentEnvironment(&quot;production&quot;),&#10;        attribute.String(&quot;cloud.region&quot;, &quot;us-east-1&quot;),&#10;        attribute.String(&quot;k8s.pod.name&quot;, os.Getenv(&quot;POD_NAME&quot;)),&#10;    ),&#10;)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">resource.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">New</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(ctx,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    resource.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">WithAttributes</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        semconv.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">ServiceName</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"payment-service\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        semconv.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">ServiceVersion</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"2.4.1\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        semconv.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">DeploymentEnvironment</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"production\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        attribute.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">String</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"cloud.region\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"us-east-1\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        attribute.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">String</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"k8s.pod.name\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, os.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Getenv</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"POD_NAME\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    ),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Resource Attribute</th>\n<th>必要性</th>\n<th>用途</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>service.name</code></td>\n<td><strong>必填</strong></td>\n<td>服务拓扑图节点标识</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>service.version</code></td>\n<td>强烈推荐</td>\n<td>版本对比、灰度分析</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>deployment.environment</code></td>\n<td>强烈推荐</td>\n<td>环境隔离（prod/staging/dev）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>k8s.namespace.name</code></td>\n<td>K8s 环境推荐</td>\n<td>多租户隔离</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>host.name</code></td>\n<td>可选</td>\n<td>定位到具体实例</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"sdk-初始化的生产模板\">SDK 初始化的生产模板</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    INIT[&quot;应用启动&quot;] --&gt; ENV[&quot;读取环境变量&lt;br/&gt;OTEL_SERVICE_NAME&lt;br/&gt;OTEL_EXPORTER_OTLP_ENDPOINT&quot;]&#10;    ENV --&gt; RES[&quot;构建 Resource&quot;]&#10;    RES --&gt; SAM[&quot;配置 Sampler&lt;br/&gt;ParentBased(Ratio)&quot;]&#10;    SAM --&gt; BSP2[&quot;注册 BatchSpanProcessor&quot;]&#10;    BSP2 --&gt; REG[&quot;设置全局 TracerProvider&quot;]&#10;    REG --&gt; RUN[&quot;应用正常运行&quot;]&#10;    RUN --&gt; SHUT[&quot;优雅关闭&lt;br/&gt;tp.Shutdown(ctx)&quot;]\">flowchart LR\n    INIT[\"应用启动\"] --&gt; ENV[\"读取环境变量&lt;br/&gt;OTEL_SERVICE_NAME&lt;br/&gt;OTEL_EXPORTER_OTLP_ENDPOINT\"]\n    ENV --&gt; RES[\"构建 Resource\"]\n    RES --&gt; SAM[\"配置 Sampler&lt;br/&gt;ParentBased(Ratio)\"]\n    SAM --&gt; BSP2[\"注册 BatchSpanProcessor\"]\n    BSP2 --&gt; REG[\"设置全局 TracerProvider\"]\n    REG --&gt; RUN[\"应用正常运行\"]\n    RUN --&gt; SHUT[\"优雅关闭&lt;br/&gt;tp.Shutdown(ctx)\"]</pre><p>关键环境变量（SDK 自动读取，无需硬编码）：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>环境变量</th>\n<th>示例值</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>OTEL_SERVICE_NAME</code></td>\n<td><code>payment-service</code></td>\n<td>等同于 Resource 的 service.name</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>OTEL_EXPORTER_OTLP_ENDPOINT</code></td>\n<td><code>http://otel-collector:4317</code></td>\n<td>Collector 地址</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>OTEL_TRACES_SAMPLER</code></td>\n<td><code>parentbased_traceidratio</code></td>\n<td>Sampler 类型</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>OTEL_TRACES_SAMPLER_ARG</code></td>\n<td><code>0.1</code></td>\n<td>Sampler 参数</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>OTEL_EXPORTER_OTLP_PROTOCOL</code></td>\n<td><code>grpc</code></td>\n<td>传输协议</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>TracerProvider 是 SDK 的中心枢纽，管理 Sampler → Processor → Exporter 全链路</li>\n<li>生产必用 BatchSpanProcessor，调优 QueueSize 和 Timeout 防止丢弃</li>\n<li>OTLP gRPC 是 2026 年的推荐默认 Exporter，兼容所有主流后端</li>\n<li>自动插桩覆盖框架层，手动插桩补充业务语义，二者互补</li>\n<li>Resource 的 service.name 是必填项，决定服务拓扑图的正确性</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li><a href=\"otel-collector-pipeline\">OTel Collector 管道编排</a>：SDK 导出的数据如何经 Collector 路由到后端</li>\n<li><a href=\"../../observability-engineering/distributed-tracing/opentelemetry\">OpenTelemetry 在可观测性工程中的应用</a>：OTel 在三大信号统一中的角色</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"OpenTelemetry SDK 架构与生产配置","id":"opentelemetry-sdk-架构与生产配置"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"TracerProvider 架构","id":"tracerprovider-架构"},{"level":2,"text":"SpanProcessor：Simple vs Batch","id":"spanprocessor-simple-vs-batch"},{"level":3,"text":"BatchSpanProcessor 关键参数","id":"batchspanprocessor-关键参数"},{"level":2,"text":"Exporter 选型","id":"exporter-选型"},{"level":2,"text":"自动插桩与手动插桩","id":"自动插桩与手动插桩"},{"level":3,"text":"自动插桩（Zero-code）","id":"自动插桩-zero-code"},{"level":3,"text":"手动插桩（Manual）","id":"手动插桩-manual"},{"level":3,"text":"最佳实践：Span 粒度控制","id":"最佳实践-span-粒度控制"},{"level":2,"text":"Resource 配置","id":"resource-配置"},{"level":2,"text":"SDK 初始化的生产模板","id":"sdk-初始化的生产模板"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"采样策略：Head-based、Tail-based 与 Adaptive","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/distributed-tracing/foundations/sampling-strategies"},"next":{"title":"OTel Collector 管道编排：Receiver-Processor-Exporter","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/distributed-tracing/implementation/otel-collector-pipeline"}}